<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1912</h1><p class="ref-lede">1912 in world history: 35 events, 25 births, 13 deaths, 2 works, 9 states founded and 6 that came to an end. 753 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
